# MITRE ATT&CK Software Analysis (S0600–S0610)

## Overview

This repository contains detailed analysis and research on multiple software entries from the MITRE ATT&CK framework, specifically software IDs S0600 to S0610.

The project focuses on:
- Malware analysis
- Threat actor associations
- ATT&CK techniques
- Persistence mechanisms
- Defense evasion
- Credential access
- Command & Control (C2)
- Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)
- Detection & mitigation strategies

---

